# Paint Shop effects end to end, on the three faces seen from cam -0.5 0.6 5 (top, left, front): Texture Fill holey_metal.bmp on
# the top, Surface Layers dirt_layer.tga on the left (Undo, again), Edge Lines dotted_rail on the front, a Decal bolt.tga
# on the left at full size, one at a smaller size turned with SHIFT, then Surface Layers Paint Entire and Edge Lines
# Edge Entire (rim_line). Rows of a list are 18 px from y 263 (row i: 272 + 18 i); the effect dropdown rows 230 + 18 i.
